<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS AT $85-1/16 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS AT $85-1/16 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-4/16 at $85-1/16 in New York on Thursday, and then eased to $85.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 448.9 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
